8. Tournament pairing subsystem

Single Elimination:
Seeds
  │
  ▼
Fixed bracket
  │
  ▼
Round 1
  │
  ▼
Winners follow bracket lineage
  │
  ▼
Semifinals
  │
  ├── winners ─────► Final
  │
  └── losers ──────► Third-place match

Example: SF1: A ─┐
                 ├── A ─┐
              B ─┘      │
                        ├── Final
              C ─┐      │
                 ├── D ─┘
              D ─┘


         SF losers:
         B ─┐
            ├── Third place
         C ─┘


Round Robin:
Participants
    │
    ▼
Circle algorithm
    │
    ▼
Entire schedule generated up front

Swiss:
Participants
     │
     ▼
Sort by:
score DESC
seed ASC
     │
     ▼
Score groups
     │
     ▼
Upper / Lower halves
     │
     ▼
Candidate search
     │
     ├── opposite half same group
     ├── same half same group
     └── lower score groups
     │
     ▼
No-rematch check
     │
     ▼
Color preference
     │
     ▼
Backtracking

