9. Tournament leaderboard subsystem

TournamentParticipant
        +
TournamentMatch history
        │
        ▼
TournamentLeaderboardService
        │
        ▼
Primary:
score DESC
        │
        ▼
Tie-break 1
        │
        ▼
Tie-break 2
        │
        ▼
...
        │
        ▼
Deterministic fallback

Supported tie-breaks:
BUCHHOLZ
BUCHHOLZ_CUT_1
SONNEBORN_BERGER
DIRECT_ENCOUNTER
WINS
BLACK_WINS
RATING
ALPHABETICAL

end:
Swiss / Round Robin:
        │
        ▼
final leaderboard
        │
        ▼
finalRank = 1..N


Single Elimination:
Final
├── winner → 1
└── loser  → 2

Third-place
├── winner → 3
└── loser  → 4

Others
└── finalRank = null

