14. Check architecture

King square
    │
    ▼
isSquareAttacked()
    │
    ├── pawn attacks
    ├── knight attacks
    ├── bishop/queen diagonals
    ├── rook/queen lines
    └── king attacks

isInCheck(color)
      │
      ▼
find king
      │
      ▼
isSquareAttacked(kingSquare, opponent)

inCheck + no legal moves = CHECKMATE
not in check + no legal moves = STALEMATE

